<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>User crendentials</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        color: #333;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 30px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 5px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }

      .header {
        text-align: center;
        background-color: #202a44;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
      }

      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 20px;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .footer {
        margin-top: 30px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #777;
      }

    .contant{
      line-height: 0;

    }

     .contant a{
      text-decoration: none;
    
      
    }

    .logininfo{
        line-height: 1;
        width: 60%;
        background-color: #202a44;
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 1px; 
        border-radius: 5px;
        
    }


.logininfo h4{
        margin-left: 10px
        
    }

      .logo {
        max-width: 120px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Your login crendentials</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Dear <%= user.name %>,</p>

        <p>
          Your login credentials for Tanika Associate are following:
        </p>

        <div class="logininfo">
            <h4>UserName: <%= user.email %></h4>
            <h4>Password: <%= user.password %></h4>
        </div>

        <p>We highly suggest you to change the password for your account! You can access your account from here: <a href="http://coopswings.ca">Tanika Associate</a></p>

       

        <p>Warm regards,<br /><strong>Team Tanika</strong><br />Transforming spaces. Creating stories.</p>
             <div class="contant">
            <h5>Email: <a href="mailto:bhavy203@gmail.com">bhavy203@gmail.com</a></h5>
            <h5>Phone: <a href="tel:+12342342345">12342342345</a></h5>
            <h5>Address: 123 Business Rd, Business City, BC 12345</h5>
          </div>

      </div>

 
      <div class="footer">
        © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Tanika Interior Design. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
